From 708218b181e3da03ffc49a33c1337a7c6654851e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andre Brait <andrebrait@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:15:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] luci-app-switchdev: add application

Add LuCI pages for the switchdev-config service under Network -> Switch
features: the switch hardware MAC address table with static entries,
port mirroring sessions and per-port rate limits. Each page shows the
active state read from bridge and tc, including whether the switch
offloaded it.

Signed-off-by: Andre Brait <andrebrait@gmail.com>
